OL,3,GNEWSAMum turns grief into lifesaving
OL,4,Alesson for teens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum who lost her son in a car crash
OL,7,F14 years ago hopes to save lives by
OL,8,Ftalking to young people about road
OL,9,Fsafety.
OL,11,FBecci Hey has taken part in Guernsey's
OL,12,Fannual tri-service initiative 'Licence
OL,13,Fto Kill', to encourage road safety
OL,14,Famong the island's year 11 students.
OL,16,FThe scheme, run by Guernsey Fire and
OL,17,FRescue Service, Guernsey Police and
OL,18,FGuernsey's Ambulance and Rescue
OL,19,FService, took place at the Performing
OL,20,FArts Centre on Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
